@startuml
title Order Delivery and Invoice Flow - Swimlane Diagram

|User|
start
:Create order in POS A;

|POS A|
:Create order record;
:Change order status to Ordered;
:Call Delivery API to Delivery B;

|Delivery B|
:Receive order;
:Set order status to Pending;
:Perform cargo process;
:Change order status to Shipped;
:Call deliverDone API to POS A;

|POS A|
:Receive shipped notification;
:Change order status to Shipped;
:Request delivery invoice from Delivery B;

|Delivery B|
:Generate PDF invoice;
:Send invoice to POS A via invoice API;

|POS A|
:Receive invoice;
:Process invoice;
:Show invoice to customer;

|User|
stop

@enduml